    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "\n## Prerequisite\n1. **Credentials:** Connect OpenWeatherMap, Groq, Zendesk\n2. **Zendesk:**. setup a trigger and webhook to send a POST request to the webhook URL in the workflow whenever a new ticket comes in\n\nThis workflow will run for every new ticket",
        "height": 194,
        "width": 388
      },
